msgstr "30 Faan"

msgid "30 Faan for having four triplets of the same number. This requires some joker tomfoolery, since it must include 6 of the same tile in one of the three suits."
msgstr "擁有四組同數字刻子可得30 Faan。這需要一些萬能牌的巧妙運用，因為須包含三種花色中某色的六張相同牌。"

msgid "30 Faan for having something like 11 22 33 44 55 66 77 in one suit in a seven-pair hand."
msgstr "七對子中含同花色的11 22 33 44 55 66 77之類牌型可得30 Faan。"

msgid "30 Faan for having something like 123 234 345 456 in the same suit."
msgstr "擁有同花色的123 234 345 456之類牌型可得30 Faan。"

msgid "30 Faan if your hand (not calls) use up all twelve of three different tiles. Without jokers, you can only get this via the shapes 111 123 33 345 555, 11 123 123 234 234, or 11 234 234 234 234 (closed pure quadruple sequence)."
msgstr "手牌（非鳴牌）用盡三種不同牌的全部十二張可得30 Faan。若無萬能牌，僅能透過111 123 33 345 555、11 123 123 234 234或11 234 234 234 234（門前清純四連順）等牌型達成。"

msgid "30 Tai"
msgstr "30台"

msgid "30 Tai for having seven flowers and drawing the eighth yourself."
msgstr "持有七張花牌並自行摸入第八張可得30台。"

msgid "30 Tai for having seven pairs plus one triplet."
msgstr "擁有七對子加一組刻子可得30台。"

msgid "30 Tai for having three wind triplets and a pair of the fourth."
msgstr "擁有三組風牌刻子及第四種風牌的雀頭可得30台。"

msgid "30 Tai for having triplets of all three dragons."
msgstr "擁有全部三元牌刻子可得30台。"

msgid "30-39 Faan"
msgstr "30-39 Faan"

