msgid "Non-discarders also pay for a win by discard."
msgstr "非放槍者亦須為打牌和牌支付。"

msgid "Nondealer ron"
msgstr "閒家榮和"

msgid "Nondealer tsumo"
msgstr "閒家自摸"

msgid "Nondiscarder payment"
msgstr "非放槍者支付"

msgid "None"
msgstr "無"

msgid "None of the other Fan apply to your hand (except for flower tiles)."
msgstr "其他番型皆不適用於你的手牌（花牌除外）。"

msgid "North Is Yakuhai"
msgstr "北為役牌"

msgid "North Wind"
msgstr "北風"

msgid "North wind is now yakuhai. (1 han for a triplet, 2 fu for a pair)"
msgstr "北風現為役牌。（刻子1番，對子2符）"

msgid "Not dead"
msgstr "未死"

msgid "Not only that, the replacement tile was our winning green dragon! Winning after a fuun replacement tile awards rinshan, which is our yaku. Declare tsumo!"
msgstr "不僅如此，補牌正是我們的和牌發財！以風槓補牌和牌可獲嶺上開花，即我們的役。宣告自摸！"

msgid "Note that 0.5 han is not enough to satisfy the 1 han minimum by itself."
msgstr "注意0.5番本身不足以滿足1番最低要求。"

msgid "Note that Fei jokers cannot be used in Gongs."
msgstr "注意飛萬能牌不能用於槓。"

msgid "Note that a double wait, such as %{t2} waiting on %{t3}, does not count. You can only have a single wait."
msgstr "注意兩面聽如%{t2}等待%{t3}不計。僅能有單一聽牌。"

msgid "Note that if you are in East seat, East Winds are counted twice."
msgstr "注意若你為東家，東風將計算兩次。"

msgid "Note that issuing a challenge costs one challenge token. You only get two per game."
msgstr "注意發出挑戰消耗一枚挑戰代幣。每場遊戲僅有兩枚。"

msgid "Note that no winning hand can include flower tiles in hand, so you must declare them (or discard them) at some point."
msgstr "注意和牌手牌不得含花牌，故你必須在某時宣告（或打出）它們。"

msgid "Note that some hands can only be won while concealed (no calls). These are marked with 'c' to the right of the Nearest Hands hands. 'x' on the other hand means 'exposed' and you can win those hands whether your hand has calls or not."
msgstr "注意部分手牌僅能門前清（未鳴牌）和牌。這些在「最接近手牌」右側標有'c'。另一方面，'x'表示「副露」，無論你的手牌是否鳴牌皆可和。"

msgid "Note that the dealer just discarded a 3 of characters, which would have completed our hand!"
msgstr "注意莊家剛打出了三萬，本可完成我們的手牌！"

msgid "Note that unlike Chii, which can only be called from your left, calling Pon messes with the turn order. The left player's turn got skipped, and now it's your turn to discard."
msgstr "注意不同於僅能鳴左家的吃，鳴碰會打亂順序。左家的回合被跳過，現在輪到你打牌。"

msgid "Note that you are not given a replacement tile for calling an added pon. This makes sense, since you aren't 'extra' one tile after calling, unlike with kan."
msgstr "注意加碰不給予補牌。這合理，因為與槓不同，鳴牌後你並未多出一張牌。"

msgid "Note that you cannot win on an opponent's discard or Kong."
msgstr "注意你不能胡對手的打牌或槓。"

msgid "Note that you were not prompted to call ton on this white dragon. Since there's no way to orient the called tile to indicate \"across\", you can only call ton from your left or your right, not across."
msgstr "注意你並未被提示對這張白板鳴Ton。由於無法將鳴取的牌定向以表示「對家」，你僅能鳴左家或右家的Ton，不能鳴對家。"

msgid "Note that your existing 3 of circles is grayed out -- it cannot be discarded. This is because we are playing with a rule called \"kuikae nashi\", i.e. no swap-calling. You cannot call with 45 of circles and subsequently discard 3 or 6 of circles."
msgstr "注意你現有的三筒已變灰——無法打出。這是因為我們採用「食替無」規則，即禁止食替。你不能以45筒鳴牌後打出3或6筒。"

msgid "Noten (AI)"
msgstr "未聽（AI）"

msgid "Noten payment"
msgstr "未聽支付"

msgid "Notenrenchan"
msgstr "未聽連莊"

msgid "Now that it's your turn, try issuing a challenge now with the leftmost button."
msgstr "既然輪到你了，請以最左側按鈕發出挑戰。"

msgid "Now that you are out of flowers, press No Flowers to pass the turn. (IRL you would say \"Pass\")."
msgstr "既然你已無花牌，請按「無花」以跳過回合。（現實中你會說「過」。）"

msgid "Now you have four sets and a pair! Click Tsumo to declare a win!"
msgstr "現在你有四組面子及一對雀頭！點擊自摸以宣告和牌！"

msgid "Now you must discard a tile."
msgstr "現在你必須打出一張牌。"

msgid "Nuki 19m"
msgstr "拔一萬九萬"

msgid "Nukidora"
msgstr "拔北寶牌"

msgid "Nukidora can be called with pon or kan to deny the nukidora."
msgstr "拔北寶牌可被碰或槓以否定其拔北。"

msgid "Number Joker (合)"
msgstr "數字萬能牌（合）"

msgid "Number of points each player starts with. You can also set this by writing the following in the Config tab: \\\"initial_score\\\": 100000"
msgstr "每位玩家的起始點數。你亦可在設定標籤中寫入以下內容來設定：「initial_score」：100000"

msgid "OMM International 2026 Card"
msgstr "OMM國際 2026卡"

msgid "Obviously (since this is a tutorial) we get the 4 of characters immediately. Press Hu to see how this hand scores!"
msgstr "顯而易見（因為這是教學），我們立即獲得四萬。按胡以查看此手牌如何計分！"

msgid "Octuple Yakuman"
msgstr "八倍役滿"

msgid "Octuple Yakuman base"
msgstr "八倍役滿基本"

msgid "Odd"
msgstr "奇數"

msgid "Offer 0"
msgstr "提供0"

msgid "Offer 1"
msgstr "提供1"

msgid "Offer 2"
msgstr "提供2"

msgid "Offer 3"
msgstr "提供3"

msgid "Oh strange, why do we have options?"
msgstr "真奇怪，為何我們有選項？"

msgid "Oka"
msgstr "場代"

msgid "Oka applies directly to chips."
msgstr "場代（オカ）直接套用於籌碼。"

msgid "Okay, do you go for the wider wait by declaring riichi on the wind, or jump for the funny wind wait by discarding 8 of bamboo?"
msgstr "好，你是要向風牌宣告立直以追求更寬的聽牌，還是打出八索以跳向有趣的風牌單騎？"

msgid "On ron, each 1s (bird) tile is worth 1 shuugi, unless the discarder's hand contains 7p (pistol) which would shoot the birds dead. That is, unless the winner's hand contains 8s (birdcage) which would protect the birds from gunfire."
msgstr "榮和時，每張一索（鳥）價值1枚籌碼，除非放槍者手牌含七筒（手槍）可將鳥擊落。除非和牌者手牌含八索（鳥籠）可保護鳥免於槍擊。"

msgid "On top of our mixed straight, we get our two flower tiles, plus All Chows (all sequences plus non-honor pair), totalling 12 points."
msgstr "在混合順子之上，我們還有兩張花牌，加上全順子（全順子加非字牌雀頭），共計12點。"

msgid "One Flower"
msgstr "一張花"

msgid "One Kong"
msgstr "一槓"

msgid "One Suji Only"
msgstr "僅一筋"

msgid "One Voided Suit"
msgstr "缺一門"

msgid "One of each dragon tile is a special tile. The special white dragon is shiro pocchi, which acts a joker tile when drawn while in riichi. The special green dragon is an aka dora. The special red dragon is the golden chun, which can be used as a five of any suit, and grants 1 han when used as a five. Completing a hand via shiro pocchi while using the golden chun as a five and having the aka green dragon scores yakuman. If playing with shuugi, a golden chun used as a five scores 2 shuugi."
msgstr "每種三元牌各有一張為特殊牌。特殊白板為白ポッチ，立直中摸到時作用如萬能牌。特殊發財為赤寶牌。特殊紅中為金中，可作為任一花色的五使用，作為五使用時給予1番。以白ポッチ完成手牌、將金中當作五使用並持有赤發時計為役滿。若使用籌碼，金中當作五使用價值2枚籌碼。"

msgid "One of each tile is replaced with a blue 'galaxy' tile that acts as a wildcard of its number. For example, %{galaxy_3s} can be used as any of %{threes}. Galaxy winds are wind wildcards, and galaxy dragons are dragon wildcards."
msgstr "每種牌各有一張替換為藍色「銀河」牌，作為其數字的百搭牌。例如%{galaxy_3s}可作為%{threes}中的任意一張。銀河風牌為風牌百搭，銀河三元牌為三元牌百搭。"

msgid "One of the eight 7p and one of the eight 7s is rainbow-colored. They are worth 10 shuugi each (same as how gold dora is worth 1)."
msgstr "八張七筒中有一張及八張七索中有一張為彩虹色。每張價值10枚籌碼（如同金寶牌價值1的換算）。"

msgid "One of the green dragons %{6z} is replaced with hatsu pocchi %{hatsu_pocchi}. Hatsu pocchi acts a joker tile when drawn with an open tenpai hand."
msgstr "一張發財%{6z}會替換為發ポッチ%{hatsu_pocchi}。發ポッチ於副露聽牌時摸到作用如萬能牌。"

msgid "One of the green dragons is red and acts as aka dora. %{akahatsu}"
msgstr "一張發財為紅色，作用如赤寶牌。%{akahatsu}"

msgid "One of the red dragons is the golden chun, which can be used as a five of any suit, and grants 1 extra han when used as a five. %{golden_chun}"
msgstr "一張紅中為金中，可作為任一花色的五使用，作為五使用時額外給予1番。%{golden_chun}"

msgid "One of the white dragons %{5z} and one of the red dragons %{7z} are replaced with shiro pocchi %{shiro_pocchi}. Shiro pocchi acts a joker tile when drawn while in riichi."
msgstr "一張白板%{5z}及一張紅中%{7z}會替換為白ポッチ%{shiro_pocchi}。白ポッチ於立直中摸到時作用如萬能牌。"

msgid "One of the white dragons %{5z} is replaced with a shiro pocchi %{shiro_pocchi}. Shiro pocchi acts a joker tile when drawn while in riichi."
msgstr "一張白板%{5z}會替換為白ポッチ%{shiro_pocchi}。白ポッチ於立直中摸到時作用如萬能牌。"

msgid "One of the white dragons is shiro pocchi. Shiro pocchi acts a joker tile when drawn while in riichi."
msgstr "一張白板為白ポッチ。白ポッチ於立直中摸到時作用如萬能牌。"

msgid "One thing you'll note is that everybody starts with a score of 35000 instead of 25000."
msgstr "你會注意到的一點是，每人起始分數為35000而非25000。"

msgid "Onjouji Toki"
msgstr "園城寺怜"

msgid "Only One Flower"
msgstr "僅一張花"

msgid "Only allow wins worth 3+ fan."
msgstr "僅允許3番以上的和牌。"

msgid "Only allow wins worth 5+ fan."
msgstr "僅允許5番以上的和牌。"

msgid "Only one hand can be scored for each win. Typically all hands are disjoint (you can't have more than one) but in the event that the winning hand is ambiguous, Riichi Advanced picks the highest-scoring one."
msgstr "每次和牌僅能計一種手牌解讀。通常所有解讀互斥（不可能有多於一種），但在和牌解讀有歧義時，Riichi Advanced會選擇得分最高者。"

msgid "Only yakuman hands can win."
msgstr "僅役滿手牌可和牌。"

msgid "Oohoshi Awai"
msgstr "大星淡"

msgid "Open Double Riichi"
msgstr "公開雙立直"

msgid "Open Hands"
msgstr "公開手牌"

msgid "Open Kokushi Musou"
msgstr "副露國士無雙"

msgid "Open Kong"
msgstr "明槓"

