msgid "Sorry for the trick question! Galaxy mahjong adds a new win condition: having an entire hand of galaxy tiles. So if you discard the 4 of bamboo, you will wait on any galaxy tile. Let's see what that looks like!"
msgstr "抱歉這是個陷阱題！銀河麻將新增一種和牌條件：整手牌皆為銀河牌。所以若你打出四索，你將聽任意銀河牌。讓我們看看那是什麼樣子！"

